  "details": "This is an ongoing issue, that I know a lot of people experience.\n\nI've checked all the settings recommended on the GUI and Help pages, doesn't seem to change anything.\n\nThis has happened across PC builds, sometimes restarting works, sometimes it doesn't.. it's just inconsistent and leads to awkward moments when trying to surprise someone with a gift.\n\nAt this point I'm thinking it'd be good if VRChat offered a \"click here if overlay doesn't open\" or \"copy link to clipboard\" that we can manually put in the Steam URL field.",
